commit 10af761313c3e2176c8c49e19fc511bbd6b62a65
Author: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 15:50:43 2026 +0000

    fix(cabinet): stop auth-failure refresh loops in shell hooks
    
    Split authFailureEpoch from stable shell context, stabilize router-backed
    callbacks with refs, and treat HTTP 403 separately from 401 for partners
    badge and prefs path refresh.
    
    Co-authored-by: Аведикян Карен <karenavedikyan@users.noreply.github.com>

